<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina to auction Letes T-bills March 18.</title>
<headline>Argentina to auction Letes T-bills March 18.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina will auction 500 million pesos of 364-day Letes treasury bills and 250 million pesos of 91-day Letes on March 18, the Economy Ministry said Thursday.</p>
<p>The sale will take place through a Dutch auction. Settlement will be on March 21.  </p>
<p>Offers are due by 1400 local/1700 GMT.</p>
<p>This is the third bill auction of the year.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newroom +541 318-0652))</p>
</text>
